title: 'spec-msg: Implement inclusion-tier match on relay chain'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Retain recent speculative-messaging commitments (`RecentProvides`) per parachain, drop backed
    candidates whose `Requires` are missing from the senders' windows, and expose the latest
    included root via `ParachainHost::newest_included_provides` (v17), returning `None` while the
    sender is offboarding. Enactment weight counts queued upward messages and the provides-window
    write separately. Its benchmark includes decoding a full `Requires` set.
crates:
- name: polkadot-runtime-parachains
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-primitives
  bump: major
- name: rococo-runtime
  bump: minor
- name: westend-runtime
  bump: minor
